<title>CANADA: Placer Dome Inc Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Placer Dome Inc Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	profit	US$0.07   profit     US$0.10</p>
<p> Net	profit	 16,000   profit	24,000</p>
<p> Revs		     283,000		  264,000</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     loss	   US$0.03   profit     US$0.15</p>
<p> Net     loss	     8,000   profit	36,000</p>
<p> Revs		     845,000		  735,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine months results includes US$43 million after tax charge for impact of leak at Marcopper mine in the Philippines.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314</p>
